<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .error-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background-color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #e74c3c;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        
        .error-face {
            font-size: 5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background-color: #4b6cb7;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #3a5491;
        }
        
        .help-text {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #777;
        }
        
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #888;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-face">😕</div>
        <h1><%= title %></h1>
        <p><%= message %></p>
        <a href="/" class="btn">Ana Sayfaya Dön</a>
        <p class="help-text">Sorun devam ederse lütfen destek ekibimizle iletişime geçin.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Psikolojik Destek Platformu
    </div>
</body>
</html>